/* TESTKIT binder source (Part 8, lesson 08-04). See
   src/qrpglesrc/testkit.sqlrpgle for the exported procedures'
   implementation and full header (build recipe, why .sqlrpgle not
   .rpgle, the *ESCAPE/callStackCtr design).

   EXPORT SYMBOL names are QUOTED, mixed-case, and match testkit.sqlrpgle's
   own dcl-proc names exactly - same reasoning as src/qsrvsrc/jucsrv.bnd's
   header (every exported procedure below uses EXTPROC(*DCLCASE), which
   pins the external name to the DCL-PROC spelling instead of the
   compiler's upper-case default - work/design/refs/ileconcepts75.txt,
   "Binder Language" section, quoted-symbol-keeps-case rule, lines
   4043-4050).

   Only one STRPGMEXP block, PGMLVL(*CURRENT) - this is TESTKIT's first
   release, so there is no PGMLVL(*PRV) history to preserve yet (same
   rule as solutions/07-05/zaisrv.bnd's own header:
   work/design/refs/ileconcepts75.txt lines 3994-3999, "Only one
   STRPGMEXP command can specify PGMLVL(*CURRENT)").

   Intended member: QSRVSRC/TESTKIT (library resolved via *LIBL, per
   docs/style-guide.md - never a hardcoded library name in source).

   BUILD RECIPE (see testkit.sqlrpgle's own header for the full
   citation trail):
     CRTSQLRPGI OBJTYPE(*MODULE) OBJ(<lib>/TESTKIT)
       SRCFILE(<lib>/QRPGLESRC) SRCMBR(TESTKIT)
       COMMIT(*NONE) CLOSQLCSR(*ENDMOD)
     CRTSRVPGM SRVPGM(<lib>/TESTKIT) MODULE(<lib>/TESTKIT)
       EXPORT(*SRCFILE) SRCFILE(<lib>/QSRVSRC) SRCMBR(TESTKIT)
       ACTGRP(*CALLER)
   <lib> is a placeholder for the learner's own library - no real
   PUB400 library or user name appears in this file. */

STRPGMEXP PGMLVL(*CURRENT)
   EXPORT SYMBOL('testInit')
   EXPORT SYMBOL('assertEqualsChar')
   EXPORT SYMBOL('assertEqualsNum')
   EXPORT SYMBOL('assertTrue')
ENDPGMEXP
